---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---

<section class="how" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lead">
      <h2 id="how-title" class="label">
        How it works?
      </h2>
      <p class="statement">
        Even if you’re not a Webflow expert, get a template and let us make the magic happen.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#templates">
        Selected templates <Arrow />
      </a>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Get a Webflow template</h3>
        <p>
          If you have a template, you’re ready to move on to the next step. If not, select one from
          our <a href="#templates">selected templates</a> or choose one from the Webflow
          marketplace.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Describe your needs</h3>
        <p>
          Tell us about your project. Are you looking for a simple tweak or a fresh redesign?{' '}
          <a href="mailto:support@fixflow.me">Let us know</a>.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Kick off your project</h3>
        <p>
          Let’s get started. Now that we know how to help you, we’ll make the magic happen.{' '}
          <a href="#faq">Any more questions?</a>
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    padding-block: var(--space-xl) var(--space-l);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .lead {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-m);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .statement {
    max-inline-size: 22ch;
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    max-inline-size: 56rem;
    margin: var(--space-xl) auto 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  .steps li {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: var(--space-m) var(--space-m) var(--space-m) calc(var(--space-m) + 3.5rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    background: #242424;
    counter-increment: step;
  }

  .steps li::before {
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-start: var(--space-m);
    inset-block-start: var(--space-m);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    inline-size: 2.5rem;
    block-size: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .steps p {
    max-inline-size: 60ch;
    color: #c9c9d1;
  }

  .steps a {
    color: var(--paper);
    text-decoration-color: var(--violet);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .steps a:hover {
    color: var(--lilac);
  }

  .how :global(:focus-visible) {
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 3px var(--ink),
      0 0 0 5px var(--lilac);
  }
</style>
